%%begintext align
%% First Man turn his Partner round and foot it clap hands
%% twice and cast off in the 2d Cu. Place .| then do the same
%% and cast off into the 3d Cu. Place :| lead thro' the 3d Cu.
%% and turn single then lead thro' the 2d Cu. turn single
%% and sett .| First Cu. take hands and slip one step down
%% and one back again then cast off and turn :|
%%endtext
