%%begintext align
%% Lead up forward and back .| That again :|
%% ##
%% Sett and turn S .| That again .|
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% First Couple slip down between the second, they slipping up .|
%% Then they slip down :|  Hands and go round :|
%% ##
%% First two Men snap their Fingers and change Places .|  Your We.
%% as much :|  Do these two Changes to the last, the rest following.
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% Sides all .|  That again :|
%% ##
%% Sett and turn S .|  That again :|
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% First two on each Side Hands and go back, meet again .|
%% Cast off and come to your Places :|
%% ##
%% First four change Places with your own .| Hands and go half
%% round :|  These Changes to the last.
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% Arms all .|  That again :|
%% ##
%% Sett and turn S .|  That again :|
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% Men back a Double, meet again .|  We. as much .:|
%% ##
%% First Cu. change with the 2d on the same Side .|  Then change
%% with your own :|  These Changes to the last.
%% [CCDM1]
%%endtext
%%sep 1 8 500
%%begintext align
%% Lead up forward and back .| that again.
%% ##
%% Set and turn S. .| that again :|
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% First couple slip down between the second
%% they slipping up .| Then they slip down .|
%% Hands and go round :|
%% ##
%% First two men snap their Fingers and change places .|
%% Your we. as much .| Do these two Changes to the last, the rest following.
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% Sides all .| That again :|
%% ##
%% Set and turn S. .| That again :|
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% First two on each side hands and go back,
%% meet again .| Cast off and come to your places :|
%% ##
%% First four change places with your own .| Hands and go half round :|
%% These Changes to the last.
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% Arms all .| that again :|
%% ##
%% Set and turn S .| That again :|
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% Men back a D. meet again .| We. as much .:|
%% ##
%% First cu. change with the 2. on the same side .| Then change with your
%% own :| These Changes to the last.
%% [DMDfD]
%%endtext
%%sep 1 8 500
