%%begintext align
%% The 1st Man sett to his own Wo. and then take hands
%% with the 2d Man and turn round into his own Place, the
%% 1st and 2d We. do the like at the same Time, then the 1st
%% Cu. cross over into the 2d Cu. Place, then all four
%% take Hands and lead up abreast, then the 1st Man cross
%% over and go below the 2d Man while the 1stWo. goes
%% below the 2d Wo. and clap Hands, then all four Hands
%% and go quite round, the other Cu. do the same .|
%%endtext
%%sep 1 8 500
% Source: sources/jc/JohnWalsh/Donawert_Pass.abc

