%% First Cu. double Hands and turn down the Middle to the 2d proper, and
%% then all four turn S. then all four Hands abreast, (the 1st Man on the
%% Outside left, and the 1st Wo. on the Outside right of the 2d Cu.) and
%% lead to the Presence, then the 1st Cu. double Hands and turn to the 2d
%% proper, then the 1st Cu. single Hands and lead up, and cast off to the 2d
%% proper, then all four sett their Backs, and take Hands and turn, 'till
%% the 1st Cu. is 2d proper.
%% [CCDM1]
%%endtext
