%%begintext align
%% Meet a D. fall back, open and close .| Fall back a D. meet, open and close :|
%% ##
%%	Back men, we. turn S. back we. men turn S. men cross over, we. cross over
%%	hands round, and go half to your places.
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% Sides with the co. we set to them .| Sides with your own wo. set to her .:|
%% ##
%%	Men turn off to the left-hand, and fall behind your we. back to back, turn back
%%	again in your places, we. as much, change Places round till you come to your
%%	own places, then take right-hands a-cross, and go round to your places :|
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% Arms as you sided :|
%% ##
%%	Men meet, we. meet, and give right-hands across, men go under their arms
%%	to your own places, men hands a-cross, and we. go under as the men did, men
%%	right-hands to the co. we. then left-hands to their own and fall into the 
%%	contrary places, hands in a ring, and go half round to your places, falling all
%%	a-breast to the presence :|
%%endtext
%%sep 1 8 500
% Source: sources/jc/JohnWalsh/Glory_of_the_West.abc

