%% man, and the 1. wo. go round the 2. wo. while the 1. wo. stands in the middle then, all three meet
%% and set to the 1. man, then 1. man and 1. wo. cast off into the 2. cu. place; The other cu. do over
%% the like.
%% [DMDfD]
%%endtext
