%%begintext align
%% The 1st Cu. take both Hand [sic] and turn down the Middle
%% into the 2d Cu. Place While the 2d Cu. cast up slow
%% and meet above .| The same again that is the 2d Cu.
%% turn down the Middle and the 1st Cu. cast up :| The two
%% Men lead to the Wall quick then change Hands and lead
%% in again then both turn round single and floor it or
%% foot it twice the We. doing the same at the same Time .|
%% Then beginning with your Partners go right Hands
%% and left half round .|
%%endtext
%%sep 1 8 500
% Source: sources/jc/JohnWalsh/Pauls_Alley.abc

