%%begintext align
%% The 1. cu. cross below the 2. cu. and go the Figure through the 3. cu. and come into the 2. cu. place .|
%% The 1. cu. being in the 2. cu. place, cast off below the 3. cu. and then lead up through the 3. cu. then
%% go the Figure above the 2. cu. and slip down between the 2. cu. :| The man being improper, all three
%% take hands and fall back, then meet .| The man cast off below the 3. cu. the wo. cast up above the
%% 2. cu. so take hands all three and fall back and meet, the 1. wo. cast off into the 2. wo. place, and the
%% 1. man cast up into the 2. man's place at the same time :|
%% [DMDfD]
%%endtext
%%text Note: Each Strain is to be played twice over.
%%sep 1 8 500
