%%begintext align
%% Honour to the presence, then to your we. Lead up forward and back, that again.
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% First, sides with your own wo. then on the other side, then both clap hands and make a pass at each
%% other and turn S. then turn your own wo. once and an half, and so on to the next 'till you come to
%% your own places.
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% Then the 1. man take his own wo. by the right-hand, holding it up 'till the 2. wo. passeth under, then
%% face about while the 2. wo. goes back again, then they three clap hands and make a pass all together,
%% and all three turn S. then take hands and do the same to the 2. man, and so the end.
%% [DMDfD]
