%%begintext align
%% The 1. cu. leads through the 2. cu. and goes without-side of the 3. cu. and stand in the 3. cu. place, then
%% cast up and turn your Partners, then Hands half round with the 1. cu. then turn your Partners into their
%% own places; then right and left till the 1. cu. comes into the 2. cu. place.
%% [DMDfD]
%%endtext
%%text Note: The 1. Strain must be played twice, and the 2. but once.
%%sep 1 8 500
% Source: sources/jc/JohnWalsh/Tyger.abc

