%%center Each strain twice
%%begintext align
%% The first Man setts to his Partner and casts off then sett
%% across with the third Couple and all four single
%% This to the first Strain play'd twice. Then the 1st
%% Man change Places with the second Woman and the
%% 1st Woman with the second Man then Hands all four
%% half round and cast off below the third Couple and lead
%% up to the Top and cast off again. This to the Last
%% strain play'd twice.
%%endtext
%%sep 1 8 500
% Source: sources/jc/JohnWalsh/Welch_Whim.abc

