%% the 1. wo. and 2. man do the same, then hands all together and go half round into your own places
%% and turn S. then the 1. wo. and the 2. man cross ovar [sic], and the 1. man and 2. wo. do the same, then all
%% take hands and go half round into their own places, then the 1. cu. cast off into the 2. place; and so
%% on to the end.
%% [DMDfD]
%%endtext
